===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An act of [[throwing]].
# {{lb|en|fishing}} An instance of [[throwing]] out a [[fishing line]].
#* {{quote-book|1=en|year=1886|translator=H.L. Br&aelig;kstad|author=w:Peter Christen Asbj&oslash;rnsen|title=Folk and Fairy Tales|page=152|passage=I went out on the timber boom and made a few '''casts''', but with little success.}}
# Something which has been thrown, [[dispersed]] etc.
